8	// before using it; a review submission used to be the one gap. It decoded
9	// records with the version pointer, so a written "version":null was
10	// explained as the built-in rules and an incomplete declaration came back
11	// with silently zeroed parameters, and accepting the submission re-encoded
12	// that record and stripped the damage out of the archive.
