37	// version-conflict or submission-id-conflict misread, naming the target
38	// chain and block plus every required extra substring, returning an empty
39	// result and leaving the archive byte-identical. A second attempt fails the
40	// same way: the declaration is neither repaired nor bypassed by a retry.
